@host = http://localhost:8080

### Service metadata
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Analyze the challenge dataset
POST {{host}}/api/v1/anomaly-detection/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

< ./challenge-request.json

### Analyze approved business context
POST {{host}}/api/v1/anomaly-detection/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

< ./business-context-request.json
